@lang en
IMPORT `cstd-nouns`

-- Manulife CSTD terms, Annexes 1 to 3: the lists of critical illnesses, as DATA.
-- GENERATED by tools/gen_annex.py from tools/conditions.py and the raw text. Do not edit by
-- hand: change conditions.py and run, from this directory,
--     python3 -I tools/gen_annex.py ../../source/raw/manulife-cstd.txt .
-- Three tables, each one CONSIDER arm per listed condition, each arm under the source lines
-- it encodes: where the condition is listed (annex and item number); the thresholds its
-- definition states, as a criterion over measured quantities; and the causes its own
-- definition excludes. What the rules do with them is cstd-annex-rules.l4.

§ `Annexes 1 to 3 — the lists of critical illnesses`

-- src:178 | Bệnh Lý Nghiêm Trọng: là các bệnh, tình trạng y tế
-- src:179 | hoặc phẫu thuật được quy định cụ thể tại Phụ Lục 1, Phụ
-- src:180 | Lục 2, Phụ Lục 3 của Hợp Đồng này.
DECLARE `A list of conditions` IS ONE OF
    -- src:1393 | DANH SÁCH CÁC BỆNH LÝ NGHIÊM TRỌNG GIAI ĐOẠN SỚM - THANH TOÁN NHIỀU LẦN
    `Annex 1, the early-stage list`
    -- src:1911 | DANH SÁCH CÁC BỆNH LÝ NGHIÊM TRỌNG GIAI ĐOẠN GIỮA THANH TOÁN NHIỀU LẦN
    `Annex 1, the middle-stage list`
    -- src:2408 | PHỤ LỤC 1  DANH SÁCH CÁC BỆNH LÝ NGHIÊM TRỌNG
    -- src:2409 | GIAI ĐOẠN CUỐI
    `Annex 1, the late-stage list`
    -- src:3147 | PHỤ LỤC 2  DANH SÁCH CÁC BỆNH LÝ NGHIÊM TRỌNG CHO NAM GIỚI
    `Annex 2, the list for men`
    -- src:3175 | PHỤ LỤC 2  DANH SÁCH CÁC BỆNH LÝ NGHIÊM TRỌNG CHO NỮ GIỚI
    `Annex 2, the list for women`
    -- src:3277 | PHỤ LỤC 3 
    -- src:3278 | DANH SÁCH CÁC BỆNH LÝ NGHIÊM TRỌNG CHO TRẺ EM
    `Annex 3, the list for children`

DECLARE `A listing` HAS
    `the list`        IS A `A list of conditions`
    `the item number` IS A NUMBER

-- A threshold a definition states, over one measured quantity; `all of` and `any of` join
-- them as the definition joins them ("và" / "hoặc"); `the stated qualitative
-- alternative` stands for a limb the definition offers IN PLACE OF a number (e.g. "ung thư
-- hắc tố xâm lấn hoặc dưới 1.5 mm"), which the specialist certifies or not.
DECLARE `A criterion` IS ONE OF
    `at least`  HAS `the quantity` IS A `A measured quantity`
                    `the threshold` IS A NUMBER
    `at most`   HAS `the quantity` IS A `A measured quantity`
                    `the threshold` IS A NUMBER
    `more than` HAS `the quantity` IS A `A measured quantity`
                    `the threshold` IS A NUMBER
    `less than` HAS `the quantity` IS A `A measured quantity`
                    `the threshold` IS A NUMBER
    `all of`    HAS `the parts` IS A LIST OF `A criterion`
    `any of`    HAS `the parts` IS A LIST OF `A criterion`
    `the stated qualitative alternative`

§§ `Where each condition is listed`

-- The item numbers are printed beside the headings in the PDF's two-column layout; in the
-- raw text they are separated from them (e.g. src:1394-1396), so each number here was read
-- against the PDF page. A sub-heading under one number carries that number.
GIVEN c IS A `A listed condition`
GIVETH A `A listing`
`the listing of` c MEANS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `carcinoma in situ`                                                                THEN `A listing` OF `Annex 1, the early-stage list`, 1
    WHEN `early prostate cancer`                                                            THEN `A listing` OF `Annex 1, the early-stage list`, 1
